0..57 Comment "/// This source states a recursive path with a call under"
58..85 Comment "/// an integer constructor."
86..89 Comment "///"
90..158 Comment "/// Integer rules can reduce the constructor to the call beneath it."
159..213 Comment "/// A recursive transport remains neutral on its path."
214..286 Comment "/// The integers and their sum follow cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Data/Int`."
287..290 Comment "///"
291..352 Comment "/// The kernel reads each endpoint through the integer rules."
353..418 Comment "/// The checker rejects a zero arm that gives the wrong endpoint."
419..422 Comment "///"
423..459 Comment "/// - see: #424 — `underSuccessor`"
